# Tango with a Tracker (battlefield.tango_with_a_tracker#helper, Boneyard Gully): Party of four at the entry: main
# (letter), bob (quest completed), cat (letter), dan (neither). The three with the letter or the quest enter; dan is
# refused with a release only. The win gives the three their 32001; dan gets nothing. Each finish changes nothing: the
# quest's 32001 (OtherAreas/TangoWithATracker.cs) completes it only when accepted with battlefieldWin set to the
# battlefield, and no char here has the quest accepted (the quest flows prove the completion).
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem LetterFromShikareeX
bob: quest OtherAreas.TangoWithATracker completed
cat: keyitem LetterFromShikareeX
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
trigger _081
update 32000 option=81
finish
bob: trigger _081
bob: update 32000 option=81
bob: finish
cat: trigger _081
cat: update 32000 option=81
cat: finish
dan: trigger _081
dan: update 32000 option=81
dan: finish
tick 2000
kill SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT
kill SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
tick 11000
